# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

branch is project
branch purpose "Compare two numbers and print their difference; a stage0 sample that both runs agree on"
branch target console
branch version "0.1.0"
branch language refined 1
branch standardLibrary 1
branch allows write console.stdout none
branch requires none
branch includesModule branch
branch entry branch.main
